# Clean code

Readable, small units. Architecture → `project-core.mdc`, `clean-architecture.mdc`.

Size and complexity limits are ESLint **errors** in `@default/eslint-config` `clean-code` (`packages/config/eslint-config/clean-code.js`). Blank lines and comments are skipped. Do not raise the limits to silence a violation — split the unit. Nest DI constructors, specs, and vendored shadcn (e.g. sidebar) may use documented app eslint overrides.

| Unit | Rule | Max |
|------|------|-----|
| Function / method | `max-lines-per-function` | 80 |
| Source file | `max-lines` | 300 |
| React component (`.tsx` / `.jsx` function) | `max-lines-per-function` | 150 |
| Class file | `max-lines` (one class per file) | 300 |
| Params | `max-params` | 4 |
| Nesting depth | `max-depth` | 4 |
| Cyclomatic complexity | `complexity` | 15 |
| Nested callbacks | `max-nested-callbacks` | 3 |
| `else` after `return` | `no-else-return` | error |
| `console.log` | `no-console` (`warn` / `error` allowed) | error |

Also enforced elsewhere:

| Rule | Where |
|------|--------|
| unused vars (`_` ok) | base / app eslint |
| `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` | typescript-eslint |
| FSD `boundaries` | frontend eslint |
| Prettier | app eslint |

Split by **responsibility**, not arbitrary cuts:

```text
✅ create-user.use-case.ts + list-users.use-case.ts
✅ UserManageSheet.tsx + useUserManageForms.ts
✅ useLoginForm.ts (UI state) — data stays in @default/hooks
❌ utils.ts mega-file / helpers.ts grab-bag
❌ one 160-line page with all sections inline
```

One file ≈ one main export (plus small private helpers). Barrel `index.ts` re-exports only.

## Style

Early `return` (`no-else-return`), no `console.log`, no `any` (`unknown` + narrow). Don’t disable a rule to hide a violation.

## Naming & casing

| What | Case | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Folders | **kebab-case** | `site-settings/`, `audit-log/` |
| Nest / package source files | **kebab-case** + role suffix | `create-user.use-case.ts` |
| React feature/shared components | **PascalCase** | `UserManageSheet.tsx` |
| Hook files | **camelCase** `use*` | `useUsers.ts` |
| Next.js App Router special files | framework names | `page.tsx`, `route.ts` |
| Variables / functions | **camelCase** | `activeUsers` |
| Classes / types / interfaces | **PascalCase** | `CreateUserUseCase` |
| Constants | **SCREAMING_SNAKE** | `MAX_OTP_ATTEMPTS` |
| CSS variables / tokens | **kebab-case** | `--primary-foreground` |
| Env vars | **SCREAMING_SNAKE** | `DATABASE_URL` |
| Package names | **@default/** + kebab | `@default/api` |
| DB tables / columns (Drizzle) | **snake_case** | `refresh_tokens` |

## Errors

Fail fast; no empty `catch`. Rethrow/log with context.

## DRY / YAGNI / KISS

Extract after real duplication (2–3+ call sites). Simplest correct solution first.
